  "description": "3D spatial indices (uniform grid, k-d tree, octree, BVH, AABB grid) with nearest / k-NN / radius / segment / ray / box queries on points or AABB-shaped items. Multi-targets netstandard2.0 + net8.0. Includes SpatialBenchmark — an empirical \"which is fastest for my data\" harness with naive O(N) fallbacks for unsupported queries and a per-query-type timeout to abort infeasible combinations.",
